This repository contains PRISM, which builds on NVIDIA Lyra (Lyra-1). Both
PRISM's own code and the Lyra code it builds on are licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0; see LICENSE.

PRISM's own contribution is Copyright (c) 2026 The PRISM Authors and consists
of the residual encoder and geometric warp prior under prism/, the training
entry points under train/, the benchmark scripts under eval/, the dataset
converter scripts/prepare_re10k.py, and the documentation under docs/.

The following components are carried over from NVIDIA Lyra
(https://github.com/nv-tlabs/lyra), Copyright (c) 2025 NVIDIA CORPORATION &
AFFILIATES, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  src/                 the 3DGS decoder (LatentRecon), data stack and
                       rendering code that PRISM predicts latents for
  cosmos_predict1/     NVIDIA Cosmos, as vendored by Lyra, used here for the
                       Cosmos tokenizer, camera trajectories and MoGe depth
  configs/             model and resolution configs, except the PRISM configs
                       named below
  ATTRIBUTIONS.md      third-party attributions for the vendored Cosmos code
  CONTRIBUTING.md

Lyra's own environment files, checkpoint download scripts and entry points are
not redistributed here; they are obtained from Lyra directly, as described in
docs/setup.md.

PRISM's own configs are configs/training/prism_init.yaml,
configs/training/prism_stage1.yaml, configs/training/prism_stage2.yaml and
configs/inference/prism.yaml.

The following files carried over from Lyra have been modified, and each carries
a notice of modification as required by Section 4(b) of the Apache License:

  src/models/data/provider.py          fixed reference frame and scene-count
                                       limit for PRISM training
  src/models/data/registry.py          dataset root for the Lyra SDG data
  src/models/data/radym_wrapper.py
  src/models/recon/model_latent_recon.py
  src/models/utils/loss.py
  configs/training/default.yaml
  configs/training/3dgs_res_704_1280_views_121_multi_6_prune.yaml
  configs/accelerate/accelerate_config_single.yaml
  cosmos_predict1/diffusion/inference/gen3c_single_image_sdg.py
  cosmos_predict1/diffusion/training/datasets/dataset_3D.py
  cosmos_predict1/diffusion/training/networks/general_dit.py

