MODEL WEIGHTS

The frozen 3DGS decoder PRISM builds on is the Lyra checkpoint, which is
released under the NVIDIA Open Model License, not Apache 2.0:

  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Lyra
  https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/agreements/enterprise-software/nvidia-open-model-license

It is not redistributed here and must be obtained from NVIDIA under that
licence. PRISM's own released encoder weights contain the residual encoder
alone.

Training data is the Lyra SDG dataset, released by NVIDIA under its own terms:

  https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/PhysicalAI-SpatialIntelligence-Lyra-SDG

